WEBVTT

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.620
Hey. Keep yer paws offa my 
get-well basket, four-eyes.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.550
What? How could you be so stingy...

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:26.500
<b>Kanzaki Hajime
Himekawa Tatsuya</b>

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.910
You could at least spare me a banana.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.910
Huh? As if...

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.830
I'll crack your friggin' skull open, baldy.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:30.340
I'm not bald. Look at my lovely do, buddy.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:35.190
Yeah, I am. And a Duck's Ass ain't 
somethin' you wear in a hospital, idiot.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.720
Don't you have any common sense?

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.530
How much?

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.980
I asked you how much for 
you to give me a banana.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.850
3 million.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.250
Huh?!

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.380
That's extortion! Hell, no!

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.350
Shut it! The son of a company president 
ain't got no right to complain!

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.360
And why are we in the same 
hospital room anyway?

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.410
Oh, my...

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.990
Kunieda?

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.750
That woman's back?

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:07.600
Yes. She finished her takeover 
of North Kanto yesterday.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.490
I hear she's even more powerful than ever.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.860
It's just a gaggle of girls in the end.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.630
Yeah. She ain't takin' Ishiyama.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.260
Now, now... Kunieda is no easy pickings.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.780
She's strong and has deep support.

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:27.270
She had the charisma to unify all the girls 
at Ishiyama when she was just a first-year.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:35.410
You got a point. If it got 
serious, you couldn't beat her.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.490
Huh? Did you forget the 
time you got beat yourself?

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.320
I know about that.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.300
That's just because I'm a feminist.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.790
I can't fight seriously against women.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.450
Nonsense.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.100
The rumors all say you got 
your ass handed to you.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.110
Oh, yeah?

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:52.440
Yeah!

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.420
Anyway, leaving that aside...

00:01:55.310 --> 00:02:00.260
It doesn't seem like Tojo's group has any 
interest in uniting Ishiyama at the moment.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:05.140
I guess we're in good little 
Oga-chan's hands for now...

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:06.570
Screw that!

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.020
Anyone but that first year punk-ass...

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.980
I'll heal! I'll heal in 3 days!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.890
Hey, you two! Fighting again?

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:15.100
I told you to quit it!

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.850
This is gonna be fun.

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.990
Natsume... You're such a...

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.410
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.810
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:29.400
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.380
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:16.980
<b>Even The Demon Lord Makes his Park Debut</b>

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.280
Look at me! It's Grampa!

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.080
Peek-a-boo!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.250
Beel-chan doesn't smile that much.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:32.080
After staring at Tatsumi's face all the 
time, his grumpiness must be contagious.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.730
Would you quit it?

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:41.380
What am I gonna do about this? 
It's even gotten bigger...

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.760
Actually, you don't smile 
much either, Hilda-chan.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.030
Is that so?

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:53.180
If that's the way it's going to be, I'll 
show you what it means to be a man!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:05:00.190
Look at this, Beel-chan! This is a man's 
secret weapon, the sliding grovel!

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:15.870
Oh, I know! Why don't you 
take him for his Park Debut?

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:19.350
Oh, that's a great idea!

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.500
He should definitely make some 
friends about the same age.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.940
Park debut?

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.110
"Park Debut"

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:34.100
It is when one first joins the community 
of children and their parents at the park.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.700
And, if you screw it up...

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.270
...you'll never live it down.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.180
Swapping information, asking for advice...

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:43.160
Also, he can make friends near his own age!

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.160
It's very important, you know.

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:51.640
Of course, thanks to you, my 
Park Debut was a giant failure.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.040
Get it now?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:55.700
Ow!

00:05:56.220 --> 00:06:00.290
And you don't have any friends since you 
came from Macao alone, right, Hilda-chan?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:04.020
Go! Take Beel-chan to the park.

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:08.210
Ooh, sounds nice. A Park Debut! Have fun.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.720
Go!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.380
Shit...

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.100
What?

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.610
Make your debut.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:27.940
It seems this Park Debut is indispensable 
for the young master's development.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.570
Take him, you bastard.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.910
Hey, hold it right there.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.580
Why won't you go?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.200
I...

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.290
Sister...

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.870
Sister?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.070
You have a sister?

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:43.510
She made a play for her 
younger sister's husband...

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.040
But it turns out that he 
used to be her boyfriend,

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.610
then the little sister realized,

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.750
she might actually be in love 
with her half-brother...

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:53.500
You see... I must watch this closely.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.100
Starting at 1:30 PM.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.740
A soap opera!?

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:00.050
And? Why did you call me out here, exactly?

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.420
Huh? 'Cause I felt like it.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.310
You felt like what?!

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:08.990
Why do I have to take a baby to the park 
with another guy in the middle of the day?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.490
I had to, okay?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:14.950
I gotta Park Debut him or somethin'...

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.550
Park Debut?

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:24.580
Park... Mothers... Young mothers... Another 
man's wife... In the early afternoon...

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.050
Thank you, Oga!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.980
You are, and will always be, my friend!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:32.350
Now then, I have a rendezvous with a 17 year 
old high school mother who just might be a witch!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.210
Hey!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.830
God damn he's useless.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:38.640
Baby Beel.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.510
Yuka, upsy-daisy!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:43.630
Baby Beel?

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:47.610
Fine, if you insist.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.850
Take this!

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:55.220
Upsy-daisy!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.250
Crap!

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:05.500
If he's more than 15 meters 
out, I'm a dead man!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:09.800
And that delinquent is always 
carrying around a baby...

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.780
Oh, yes! I've heard this as well.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.760
For some reason, the baby's 
always naked, right?

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.090
Naked?

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.140
But, why?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.490
How should I know?

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.930
Isn't that child abuse?

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.640
It's been happening more and more lately.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:23.030
Frankly, it frightens me...

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:24.020
Oh, look!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:27.650
Taking a walk again today, Aoi-chan? 
You're such a good girl...

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.420
Hello.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.090
Who's that?

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:34.890
She's the daughter of the 
temple priest in 5th block...

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.600
My, she's young...

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.110
Only 17 years old!

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.570
17 years old?!

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.410
I can't believe it!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.720
Honestly, young people these days...

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:47.490
I can hear you, damn it!

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.860
Kota isn't even my kid!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.550
He's my little brother!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.670
Um, just so you know, he's not...

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:57.800
What the...

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.930
A shooting star?

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:01.640
That's...

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.930
A baby?!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.310
Outta my way!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.080
That was close.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.190
I wasn't really thinking back there.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.620
I was <i>this</i> close to 15 meters...

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:25.510
Upsy-Daisy's a game of life and death.

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:30.540
That's him! That's the delinquent 
the rumors are about.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.170
The naked baby!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:33.920
It's child abuse, definitely!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.700
Better not get involved...

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.760
He totally just threw his baby.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.210
This is my chance to make my Park Debut!

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:46.520
I have to do something to 
make a good impression.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.270
Baby Beel, smile.

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.020
Hello! Nice to meet you.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.830
This little guy's Baby Beel...

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.450
Howdy.

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.770
Huh? That didn't work?

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.640
W-Wait, could he be...

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.780
Maybe we need to be more friendly...

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.080
Baby Beel, smile more.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:13.380
What lovely weather we're having today!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.610
Huh, that's odd.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:22.930
H-Hey...

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.980
Please, do it with me!

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:40.940
Uh...

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:43.840
Was I just confessed to?

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:46.170
But, I can't just, like that...

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.250
He looks serious...

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.130
The kid's totally glarin' at me!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:07.200
Um... I don't really know 
anything about you...

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:10.350
Yeah. And I don't know much about you.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:11.850
That's... the point.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.080
You know, the Park Debut thing.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.280
Park Debut?

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:34.590
Park Debut.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.060
"Do it with me?"

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.640
Was that what you meant?

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.750
What else would it mean?

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.640
What a jerk...

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:55.020
You can't have a Park Debut like that!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.880
But I don't know what I should do!

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.590
Idiot! Don't go thinking 
a Park Debut is so easy!

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:05.030
It's not something a novice 
should approach lightly!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.240
So, you've done it? The Park Debut thing...

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:12.160
Me? I... was planning to today.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.150
Sure, I'll go along with you!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.170
You and me.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.240
Oh, that'll really help me out!

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.140
Sorry 'bout this.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:22.900
I can't tell him that I never 
actually spoke with anybody yet...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:27.050
But... Maybe I'll try using these notes.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.810
We'll start with the introduction.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:32.790
Or not.

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:39.380
Casually bring up some mutual topic 
of conversation, like baby supplies.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.260
All I have are these 
diapers and the pacifier.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:44.530
Oh? That's all?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.820
Well, if that's all, it'll do.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.840
W-What brand are those?

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:50.970
Daipies.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.180
The ones called the mystical diapers?!

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:55.580
We can do this!

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.890
Did you just say those are the 
"Diapies" everyone is talking about?

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:01.640
Wow! Amazing!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:02.860
Daipies?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:03.900
No way!

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.360
Amazing! Where did you buy them from?

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:08.970
All right! They're totally hooked in!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:13.980
You see, at the drug store in front of the 
train station these bank robbers happened by...

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:18.730
After I put 'em all down, the manager 
there gave me a life-time supply.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:19.800
Robbers?

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.180
All of them?

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.290
Put them down?

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.890
Um, next...

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:31.490
Get the children to play together with a toy.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.830
Toy? I didn't bring any.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:37.020
I didn't bring one either.

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.450
I guess that one won't work.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:42.300
Are we having a quandary 
Monsieur et Mademoiselle?

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.580
What the hell are you here for?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.410
It is only chivalrous for a 
gentleman to help those in need.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.120
Uh, that's not what I meant.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.040
Who is he?

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.910
He's... You know... That.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.020
Baby Beel's...

00:13:56.020 --> 00:14:01.150
I am related to the child, 
and my name is Alaindelon.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.860
At your service.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.090
Right. Um...

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:07.460
At your service, too?

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:15.690
Now, please use this toy, if you'd like.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.540
Thank you very much.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:21.210
Wait, did he have a toy?

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:28.830
If you'd like, why don't we let 
them play with this toy together?

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.200
What is with these weird people?

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.350
Sorry. It doesn't look 
like anything worked...

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:51.230
Aren't we forgetting something 
more important than toys?

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:16.510
But... We just met, and...

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:19.170
I don't know much about you at all...

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:22.330
Um, I...

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.850
There! Baby Beel!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:34.120
Yeah, that's the way, Baby Beel!

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.110
W-What are you doing?

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:39.200
You know... the Park Debut match?

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.540
I think you're confusing this with K-1...

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.590
Hey, Kota! Don't fight back!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.200
Do it, Baby Beel!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.820
Master!

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:52.430
Kota, you can do it!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.030
Baby Beel!

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:57.940
Weak.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:03.900
Ah... When Master Beel isn't attached 
to Oga, he becomes so weak!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.600
It is unavoidable, I'm afraid.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.650
Don't just blab on like 
it's not your problem!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.220
Don't cry, Baby Beel!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:17.110
What's this? I sense that Furuichi-dono 
is in trouble elsewhere!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.450
It is only chivalrous for a 
gentleman to help those in need.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.430
If you'll excuse me!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.610
Hold it right there, big guy!

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.010
I almost forgot, Oga-dono...

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:34.570
Here. Now, squeeze this part...

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.600
Nice and tight...

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:38.680
Nice and tight.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:43.580
...if you do that it'll 
explode, so be careful.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.660
That bastard...

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:48.330
Huh?

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:49.940
Baby Beel?

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.650
Kota?

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:53.470
Crap!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.620
You! Search over there!

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:58.660
Right!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:02.300
Man, where the hell did he go?

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.430
7.8 meters!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.110
10.1 meters.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:08.630
Getting colder.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.830
5.9 meters.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.590
Oga-dono, that is the way.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.970
6.4 meters... Ah, so close!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:22.730
14.6 meters. Warning, warning! You're 
a candle flickering in the wind!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.920
Shut the hell up!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.110
T-There you are!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:38.500
What the hell have you been doing?

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.630
Makin' me worried like that...

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.180
Did you find them?

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.310
Oh... He's not really such a bad guy.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.170
Officer, he's over there!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.440
This way!

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:53.580
Hurry up!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.320
Aoi-chan, are you okay?

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:57.030
H-Hold it...

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.140
That's him over there! A big guy 
that was with him just split open!

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:04.810
A strange doll tried to eat my baby alive!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.380
Really?

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.690
I think your eyes must have 
been playing tricks on you...

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.420
Of course not!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.070
I'll sue you for dereliction of duty!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:15.850
Anyway, there's clear evidence of 
child abuse right in front of you!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:18.880
Crap, I don't get this...

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.020
I wanted to get home early 
and get to my video games...

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.770
A perfect 10!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.040
This is my lucky day!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:33.560
Sometimes this thankless job has its perks. 
Goin' along with those old broads ain't so bad!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.900
He's alone?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:43.100
That "big guy" they mentioned 
don't seem to be around, lucky me.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:49.160
You there, is it true that you scared 
those women over there with something?

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:52.520
And they also said something 
about child abuse?

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.190
Now that I look at him, he's 
not wearing anything...

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:59.230
Oh, yeah? Don't screw with me, buddy.

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:01.780
If anything, I'm the one bein' abused by him!

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:07.800
Damn it, what's the punk 
starin' right at me for?

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.200
All these damn delinquents in town...

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.290
Let me teach you a thing 
or two about being polite.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:17.260
I'd like you to come to the station for now.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.390
W-Wait, please!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.480
Without any proof...

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:27.810
Hey, why are you covering for him?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.600
I see. So that's it.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:35.660
You're the same as him.

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:40.660
Ah, there goes my fantasy... I had 
hoped you'd be a better girl than that.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:42.450
Oh, yeah?

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:47.550
Man, you human trash just go 
stickin' together so soon...

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:48.950
How old are you?

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.590
17. And...?

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:56.600
You should really get better taste in guys.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:59.480
Goin' out with a guy like 
this is a total waste!

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.200
Delinquents like him are society's 
trash, and they always will be!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.430
And anyway, he's got a bastard kid already!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:12.560
If you brats keep raising more brats, 
the country's in big trouble!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:16.260
That's my line!

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:26.860
You bastard! You think 
you'll get away with that?

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.000
That's a serious crime!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.140
Assaulting a police officer!

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:33.450
I'll throw you in the slammer!

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.790
I'll lock you up and throw away the key!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.630
Hey, look what we got here!

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:42.150
W-What are you gonna do?

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:42.930
Let me down!

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:45.550
I was also thinking about 
slamming you into something.

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.460
Gotta...

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.520
...throw out the trash!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.010
Laters!

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.710
He ran away!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:05.030
Get back here!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.150
Why, you...

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:10.560
He stopped me from hitting him?

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:13.910
It couldn't be...

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.650
Let's go home, Kota.

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.670
I forgot to ask him his name...

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.430
Yo...

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.310
Yo...

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:39.820
Yo...

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.990
Welcome home, Madame Aoi.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:50.200
I have returned.

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:52.700
You went to the park in that outfit again?

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:57.620
<b>Kunieda</b>

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:57.880
I have no choice. You can't have 
the leader of the Red Tails,

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:01.400
the strongest ladies of Kantou, 
seen carrying around a child.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:04.340
As expected of you, Madame.

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:08.680
Madame, it is time for the general meeting.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:10.980
Yes. I'm coming now.

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:12.470
<b>Violent</b>

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:13.470
<b>Anger</b>

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:14.480
<b>Empress</b>

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:15.480
<b>Lapis</b>

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.980
<b>Kunieda Aoi</b>

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:03.800
Ishiyama's Queen has returned!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.400
And I hear she's a real beauty!

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:08.550
Queen? You mean Ishiyama 
wasn't an all-boys school?

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:10.640
Oga Tatsumi, prepare yourself.

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:12.520
Your evil ways end here!

00:24:12.520 --> 00:24:14.630
It's Queen Kunieda!

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:17.700
Ooh, Baby Beel likes her!

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:20.020
Okay, then! She's your new 
mother, starting today!

00:24:21.570 --> 00:24:24.150
On the next Beelzebub: We met again.

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:26.520
Huh? You mean we met somewhere before?
